From: Winter21c <winter@localhost>
Subject: arm64: dts: qcom: sm8150-xiaomi-raphael: front S5K3T2 node

Supersedes the borrowed-driver trick of patch 0006 for the front module.  With
camera/drivers/s5k3t2.c available, the node can use its real compatible string.

Front module facts (from the stock camera DT, `qcom,cam-sensor@2` = CAMF_*):
CSIPHY1, CCI0 master0 (so it answers on /dev/i2c-3 next to the wide IMX586 at
0x1a and the EEPROM at 0x54), MCLK2 = tlmm gpio15, reset = tlmm gpio12,
VDIG enable = tlmm gpio95, plus the PM8150 LDO17 3.1 V rail.

The I2C address is a placeholder: the stock DT does not carry one and the module
has never been powered on mainline.  0x10 is the usual Samsung default; if the
probe fails, load the driver with keep_power=1 and scan /dev/i2c-3 (0x20 and 0x21
are the next candidates) - the same procedure that found the tele OV8856 at 0x36.

Signed-off-by: Winter21c <winter@localhost>
---
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8150-xiaomi-raphael.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8150-xiaomi-raphael.dts
@@ 	camera_vdig_tele: regulator-camera-vdig-tele {
 		vin-supply = <&vreg_bob>;
 	};
+
+	/* front module VDIG enable, stock DT CAMF_VDIG_EN */
+	camera_vdig_front: regulator-camera-vdig-front {
+		compatible = "regulator-fixed";
+		regulator-name = "camera_vdig_front";
+		regulator-min-microvolt = <1200000>;
+		regulator-max-microvolt = <1200000>;
+		enable-active-high;
+		gpio = <&tlmm 95 GPIO_ACTIVE_HIGH>;
+		vin-supply = <&vreg_bob>;
+	};
@@ 		i2c-bus@0 {
 			reg = <0>;
 			clock-frequency = <400000>;
+
+			/* front camera: S5K3T2, CSIPHY1, MCLK2 gpio15,
+			 * reset gpio12, VDIG_EN gpio95 */
+			s5k3t2_front: camera@10 {
+				compatible = "samsung,s5k3t2";
+				reg = <0x10>;
+				reset-gpios = <&tlmm 12 GPIO_ACTIVE_LOW>;
+				clocks = <&camcc CAM_CC_MCLK2_CLK>;
+				clock-names = "xvclk";
+				assigned-clocks = <&camcc CAM_CC_MCLK2_CLK>;
+				assigned-clock-rates = <19200000>;
+
+				avdd-supply = <&vreg_bob>;
+				dovdd-supply = <&camera_viodd_ldo>;
+				dvdd-supply = <&camera_vdig_front>;
+				vl17-supply = <&vreg_l17a_3p0>;
+				status = "okay";
+			};
 		};
